{"3754530":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"PURPLEARC","steam_appid":3754530,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>「Action games are so fun, aren't they?」<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A beautiful world,<br>a deep story,<br>imaginative flavor text...<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...Instead of all that,<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I made this game so even people who don’t usually play action games can feel that it’s <i>fun<\/i>.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >---<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Special moves of the main character:<\/strong><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >• <strong>Glide<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spread your wings and glide. The floaty feeling of flying far might get you hooked?<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3754530\/extras\/e9c2c88bf157cf9ca436a6155bb9525a.poster.avif?t=1776245802\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3754530\/extras\/e9c2c88bf157cf9ca436a6155bb9525a.mp4?t=1776245802\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >• <strong>Super Dash<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The longer you keep running on the ground, the faster you go. It makes the glide even more powerful—guaranteed to feel great.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3754530\/extras\/99c3f468e4cda2381e644f5ea8ec8e2e.poster.avif?t=1776245802\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3754530\/extras\/99c3f468e4cda2381e644f5ea8ec8e2e.mp4?t=1776245802\" type=\"video\